    "updated_at": "2019-04-02T20:32:55Z",
    "body": "Test was upstreamed in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/16173 and results are here:\r\nhttps://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/media-elements/playing-the-media-resource/loop-from-ended.tentative.html?run_id=4787946901209088&run_id=6203324013477888&run_id=4795949129924608\r\n\r\nSafari actually passes if one loads http://w3c-test.org/html/semantics/embedded-content/media-elements/playing-the-media-resource/loop-from-ended.tentative.html and clicks the document as it's loading.\r\n\r\n@whatwg/media and @cpearce + @jyavenard in particular, do you think specifying this behavior would make sense?",
